        },
        "quote": "(b) Expansion of legal nonconforming uses and/or structures is prohibited unless a determination of “no adverse impact” by the Planning Director is obtained based on the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.200.080:block:1#text",
